SUMMARY:Crazy Little Thing Called Love
DESCRIPTION:Part concert. Part comedy. Way more fun than couples therapy. C
 lassic pop-rock favorites burst to life\, woven with intimate\, cabaret-st
 yle moments where performers share funny\, heartfelt stories about love 
 — the kind that will have you laughing one minute and leaning a little c
 loser to the person beside you the next. A powerhouse band fuels iconic an
 thems with electric sing-along energy\, while those in-between moments mak
 e it feel personal and quite playful. It’s fresh and yet nostalgic — a
  celebration of love in all its forms and phases — steady\, surprising\,
  hard-earned\, and deeply felt… in a concert experience that’ll leave 
